{"id":"beece31c63e836af","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-positive-forcing.md","title":"ZFC Ideal7 Ideal Positive Forcing","display":"df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-positive-forcing — ZFC Ideal7 Ideal Positive Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-positive-forcing","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-positive-forcing"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-positive-forcing — ZFC Ideal7 Ideal Positive Forcing","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-on-set]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-positive-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-positive-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-positive-forcing — ZFC Ideal7 Ideal Positive Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"57e0cc0c038bbcc0\" href=\"?note=57e0cc0c038bbcc0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-on-set\">58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-on-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> (ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"57e0cc0c038bbcc0\" href=\"?note=57e0cc0c038bbcc0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-on-set\">58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-on-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span>-positive conditions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (forcing order relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S\\)</span> (upstream ideal-on-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"57e0cc0c038bbcc0\" href=\"?note=57e0cc0c038bbcc0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-on-set\">58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-on-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7IdealPositiveForcing}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7IdealPositiveForcing}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}positive\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7IdealPositiveForcing}_S(X,\\mathcal I,P,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S(X,\\mathcal I)\\land P=\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\mathcal I\\land R=\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in P\\times P\\mid A\\subseteq B\\}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}positive\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7IdealPositiveForcing}_S(X,\\mathcal I,P,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S(X,\\mathcal I)\\land P=\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\mathcal I\\land R=\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in P\\times P\\mid A\\subseteq B\\}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC ideal definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-ide